``` Off-Hours Privileged Logon
    Purpose : Find privileged logons outside business hours (default 07:00-19:00,
              Monday to Friday, in the indexer's time zone).
    Data    : Windows Security log, EventCode 4672 (special privileges assigned
              to new logon).
    Controls: AC-2(12), AC-6(9), AU-6
    Tuning  : Exclude SYSTEM and machine accounts (ending in $). Maintain an
              on-call lookup so scheduled after-hours work is not flagged.
    Example environment: Harborlight Logistics (fictional). ```
index=wineventlog sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4672
| where NOT match(SubjectUserName, "[$]$") AND SubjectUserName!="SYSTEM"
| eval hour=tonumber(strftime(_time, "%H")), wday=strftime(_time, "%a")
| where hour < 7 OR hour >= 19 OR in(wday, "Sat", "Sun")
| stats count AS logons min(_time) AS first max(_time) AS last values(ComputerName) AS hosts BY SubjectUserName
| convert ctime(first) ctime(last)
| sort - logons
